<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 4.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 4.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.15 vs   2.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.76 vs   3.96</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.88 vs   3.83</p>
<p> Sales		   36.88 vs  30.21</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.39 vs   8.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	27.20 vs  15.60</p>
<p> Operating profit    27.28 vs  16.61</p>
<p> Sales		  174.42 vs 147.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
